	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Excusationem tuam, mi frater, accipio ea tamen <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>lege, ut, quoties licet per ocium scribas saltem aliq<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>uid de rebus nostris et Italicis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ego quidem scriberem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>libenter de rebus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l822">Germanicis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>si quid haberem certi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Multa quidem circumferuntur, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sed fama dumtaxat dubia nunciatrice, atqui non <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>libenter de incertis verbis facio.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Condonabunt itaque <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mihi fratres, si per te de rebus dubiis nihil accipiunt; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non negligentia aut contemptu hoc fit, sed necessitate.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Nunc paucis, quae habeo, annoto.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In expeditione po<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>strema in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> paucissimi ex nostris sunt profecti.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Eripit magistratus profectis et elapsis omnem relictam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>substantiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> ex suis supra 100 coeperunt, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>dum <placeName ref="l1483">Nydovium</placeName> transirent, vinctosque binos deduxere <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> omnes.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Inde ablegarunt quemlibet in locum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>suum et ad suum praefectum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Iubentur passim omnes civitates <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et praefecturae in agro <placeName ref="l41">Bernensi</placeName> publicis i<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>udiciis <foreign xml:lang="de">(mitt landtgerichten)</foreign> decernere, quid poenae <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>irrogandum his.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Audio autem deferri in eos sent<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>entiam capitalem; nondum tamen ullos audio truncatos; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>periclitabuntur, si qui aliis fuere authores <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>proficiscendi in militiam.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l167">Genevensis</placeName> respublica <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>articulos pacificationis inter Sabaudum et ipsos a <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName> compositos recepit; nunc expectatur principis <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>responsio atque consensio.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> habemus, quod tamen <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>non affrimo, sed, uti accepi, refero: diu iam malo <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>dolo actum esse de componendo bello; nunc vero, cum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dolus est detectus, utrinque apparatus fieri graves.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dicitur <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>rex obsessurus Charitem, admirallium obsidionem, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>si possit, soluturum et obtinuisse <placeName ref="l1176">Massiliam</placeName>, quod tamen apu<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>d me adhuc est dubium etc.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l862">Helvetos</placeName> nuper profectos haerere adhuc <placeName>S<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>alone</placeName> in <placeName ref="l2954">Campania</placeName> et iam c<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>oepisse certare cum peste et rerum omnium penuria; expectare aurum, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sed nuspiam hoc hactenus apparuisse ideoque cantaturos non <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>paucos: <foreign xml:lang="de">'O were ich daheymen in mines vatters <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>schüre'</foreign> etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Tumultus in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> excitatos a pa<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>pistis horum viribus fractis esse sedatos nuper, opinor, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ad te perscripsi; sed novas turbas datas in <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> ob gubernatorem glande traiectum bonbardiae.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>In <placeName ref="l869">Transsylvania</placeName> et <placeName ref="l882">Hungaria</placeName> audio vehem<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>enter gliscere virus<note type="margin">a. R. vires!</note></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Arianorum ob <persName ref="p7955">Blan<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>dratae</persName>, impiissimi hominis, familiaritatem cum <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>rege, nec decrescit haec zizania in <placeName ref="l2472">Polonia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>In <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> sunt gravissimae concertationes <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et noxiae inter theologos Ihenenses contra <placeName ref="l558">Wite<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>bergenses</placeName> et <placeName ref="l284">Lipsenses</placeName> de iustificatione etc.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Ti<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ment multi rem hanc ad manus perventuram.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><persName>Ioannes Wilhelmus</persName>, <placeName ref="l749">Saxoniae</placeName> dux, defendit Ihenenses, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>contra elector <persName>Augustus Witebergenses</persName>, unde <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>equitatus, qui coeperat parari a <persName>Ioanne Wilhelmo</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>in auxilium <persName ref="p20341">regis Galliae</persName>, nunc alio respicit.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Nuptiae <persName>Casimiri</persName> et filiae <persName>Augustae</persName> 4. iunii <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>celebrabuntur <placeName ref="l210">Heydelbergae</placeName>, ubi maximus nunc <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>fit apparatus, quasi vero etc.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Imperator con<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>scripsit comitia <placeName ref="l471">Spiram</placeName> ad dominicam trinitatis <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>quae multi minime processura putant; alii contrarium <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>urgent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Tributum imperator petit a <placeName ref="l2449">Bo<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>hemis</placeName>, <placeName ref="l921">Moravis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l449">Silesiis</placeName> tantum, quantum regum <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>nullus unquam postulavit, supra 70 tinnas<note type="margin">a.R.: tunnas?</note>.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Si perrexerit, quid futurum putas?</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Breviter: ex nullis prope locis saltem tollerabilia <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>scribuntur.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Sed hoc est iustum dei iudicium, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>quod praecedit magnum illud et ultimum.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/>Dominus Iesus misereatur nostri et servet te ab <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>omni malo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 14. aprilis in hyeme sati<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>s dura etc. 1570.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Saluta nostros amicos, <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>quos scis, d. d. consules, <persName ref="p1770">Carolum</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontisellam</persName>, <persName ref="p20473">Ganthnerum</persName> e<lb xml:id="p2z30"/>t ordine alios omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p495">H[einryc<lb xml:id="p2z31"/>hus] B[ullingerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z32"/>Qui has tibi fert literas <persName>Rhetus</persName>, est vir pius et <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>doctus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Habitat apud <persName ref="p8442">Simlerum</persName> meum et redibit <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>forsan intra 14 dies ad nos.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Compater <lb xml:id="p2z35"/>meus est, levavit filio meo <persName ref="p487">Heinrycho</persName> filium <lb xml:id="p2z36"/><persName>Ioannem</persName> ex sacro fonte; commendo ergo hunc tibi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Unum adhuc abs te obnixe peto, ut nova, quae <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>hactenus commemoravi, transscripta et tuis inclusa <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>literis, meis item his <persName>Friderycho</persName> inscriptis a me <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>tuis adiunctis ad ipsum cures perferri mature.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z5"/>Hac in plurimum mihi gratificaberis et me <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>onere et laboribus liberabis.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum iterumque vale<lb xml:id="p3z7"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Tuus idem ille.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p4z2"/><persName ref="p8016">Tobiae Eglio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>ecclesiae ministro <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>fideli, symmystae <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>et fratri meo dilectissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z6"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
